-----------------------------------------------------------
Fonts referenced by name only
-----------------------------------------------------------

Some themes allow selecting fonts such as "Noto Serif KR",
"Nanum Myeongjo", "Nanum Gothic", "IBM Plex Sans KR", "Noto Sans KR",
"Georgia", etc. These font files are NOT bundled with this software.
They are only referenced by family name; rendering relies on the fonts
being available on the user's system or via the browser's fallback chain.
